Both blockers are forbidden to fix under the Honesty Covenant (#6/#7) and the allowed-files constraint. The gate log (`.github/prompts/monorepo/logs/p4-apple-shared-surfaces-0165-BottomTabBar.log`) records every command, exit code, and verbatim error, ending with `EXIT=65 / STATUS=BLOCKED`.

